  "answer": "Drafted as a GM note for Area 5 / Arrive Hempholm.\n\nIt frames the Grotesque Tree as an immediate threat in the garden: armor-tough bark, thorny branches, melee plus ranged retaliation, nearest-enemy focus, and it calms once the party is no longer under imminent threat.\n\nI also kept the precious metal leaves out of any read-aloud and confined them to a Perception-gated clue or post-fight search.",
